    "body": "<!-- claude-projects-attribution: {\"github_login\":\"siainbuletin\"} -->\n_Requested by **Sia** · [project thread](https://claude.ai/code/project/chan_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2?thread=cmsg_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW25hpPrxDU9jUYPwDwRgDUXd)_\n\n## Summary\n\n- **Problem:** Emacs asks \"Symbolic link to Git-controlled source file; follow link?\" for every Stow-linked file.\n- **Cause:** `vc-follow-symlinks` was set only by `sp-auto-follow-symlinks`, which only `sensible-defaults/use-all-settings` (in `sp-helper-funct`) calls. Nothing calls that function, so the setting never ran.\n- **Fix:** `sp-navi` calls `(sp-auto-follow-symlinks)` when it loads, so `vc-follow-symlinks` is `t`. The buffer visits the real file in `~/dotfiles`.\n- Docs: `sp-navi.org` section rewritten as bullets; `.el` matches the doc; `sp-vcontrol.org` now says \"called when `sp-navi` loads\".\n- No CHANGELOG edit.\n- **Not changed:** the other helpers that only `use-all-settings` would call (for example `sp-open-from-home-dir`) are still never run.\n- **Not tested by Claude:** no Emacs in the container; the change is one top-level call.\n\n## Manual testing\n\n- [x] `cd ~/dotfiles; git fetch origin 493-follow-symlinks-without-asking; git checkout 493-follow-symlinks-without-asking`, restart Emacs (or `M-x sp-reload-modules`) (untested by Claude)\n- [x] `C-h v vc-follow-symlinks`: value is `t`\n- [x] `C-x C-f ~/.config/emacs-modular/init.el`: opens with no prompt; `C-h v buffer-file-name` shows the path under `~/dotfiles/...`\n- [x] Edge: open a symlink to a file that is not in Git: opens with no prompt\n- [x] Regression: `M-x magit` (`C-M-g`) from that buffer finds the `~/dotfiles` repository\n- [x] Regression: open a normal, non-link file: nothing changes\n\n<details><summary>Revert after testing</summary>\n\n- Discard local edits made while testing: `git -C ~/dotfiles status`, then `git -C ~/dotfiles restore .`.\n- Return to main: `git -C ~/dotfiles switch main` and `git -C ~/dotfiles pull`.\n- Optionally delete the test branch locally: `git -C ~/dotfiles branch -D 493-follow-symlinks-without-asking`.\n- Restart Emacs (or `M-x sp-reload-modules`).\n\n</details>\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiAcvqv2EdH5ejwfdf4)_",
