                "message": "🐛 Follow symlinks without asking when visiting a file\n\nsp-auto-follow-symlinks was only reachable through\nsensible-defaults/use-all-settings, which nothing calls, so\nvc-follow-symlinks stayed at its default and Emacs asked about every\nStow-linked file. Call it when sp-navi loads.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiAcvqv2EdH5ejwfdf4",
